I'll share few sets of questions that I recently faced:
-Please describe a time when you went out of your way to help someone resolve an issue or problem. What did you do to help, and what was the result?
-Tell me about a time when a work or school related goal interfered with a personal goal. How did you manage the conflict?
-Describe a time when you had to work with people from other departments or teams and someone was not collaborating as they should, how did you approach the situation?
-Tell me about a time when you thought “There has to be a better way” and you created a better way, what did you do and what was the impact?
-Give me an example of a time when you provided support to someone who needed help accomplishing a shared goal or project.
-Tell me about a big mistake you've made on job and how you handled it?


